<item><title>Tayebwa backs UWA’s expanded forest role and seeks resources</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/tayebwa-backs-uwa-s-expanded-forest-role-and-seeks-resources-cbe5af/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/tayebwa-backs-uwa-s-expanded-forest-role-and-seeks-resources-cbe5af/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>The deputy speaker pledged Parliament’s support as the wildlife authority takes over central forest reserves and seeks a helicopter for its operations.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:53:21 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Stellenbosch selects Uganda’s Winnie Byanyima for honorary commerce doctorate</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/stellenbosch-selects-uganda-s-winnie-byanyima-for-honorary-799087/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/stellenbosch-selects-uganda-s-winnie-byanyima-for-honorary-799087/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>The university named the outgoing UNAIDS chief among seven recipients, citing her work on social justice, women’s rights and global inequality.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:00:30 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Museveni appoints Nawangwe to lead higher education regulator</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/museveni-appoints-nawangwe-to-lead-higher-education-d231a3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/museveni-appoints-nawangwe-to-lead-higher-education-d231a3/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>The National Council for Higher Education had gone months without a substantive chair, delaying some decisions requiring the full council.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 04:00:48 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Kiira Motors builds Uganda’s vehicle industry from a university prototype</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/kiira-motors-builds-uganda-s-vehicle-industry-from-a-9b9c6c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/kiira-motors-builds-uganda-s-vehicle-industry-from-a-9b9c6c/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>The company’s Jinja plant is designed to produce up to 5,000 vehicles a year as it advances electric buses and regional-market plans.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:41:02 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Uganda urges banks to expand lending to women entrepreneurs</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-urges-banks-to-expand-lending-to-women-entrepreneurs-2048dd/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-urges-banks-to-expand-lending-to-women-entrepreneurs-2048dd/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>At a Kampala event, the central bank said 40% of women were in business, but only nine per cent had access to commercial loans.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:47:52 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-urges-banks-to-expand-lending-to-women-entrepreneurs-2048dd/share.jpg" length="42033" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-urges-banks-to-expand-lending-to-women-entrepreneurs-2048dd/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
